[
  {
    "id": "or_acceptance_training_01_main",
    "title": "新手术室验收与训练",
    "background_id": "new_operating_room",
    "start": "act1_open",
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "act1_open",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "【第一幕：启用前】\n新手术室还没有安排患者。无影灯、麻醉机和监护设备全部亮着待机灯，空气里只有新设备、消毒剂和塑封材料的气味。",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "act1_open_next",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "asuka_open",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ],
        "hide_portrait": true
      },
      {
        "id": "asuka_open",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「今天普通手术停排。不是因为出了事故——是好事。」\n明日香站在门口，白大褂外套着一次性隔离衣，语气仍然温和。\n「新手术室正式交付。今天从患者被送到门外开始，一直走到手术结束后的转运。每个人都要知道自己什么时候开口、什么时候复核。」",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "asuka_open_next",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "player_reply",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ],
        "actor_id": "doc_asuka",
        "outfit": "white_coat"
      },
      {
        "id": "player_reply",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "「换句话说，今天要尽量把问题都暴露出来。」",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "player_reply_next",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "asuka_reply",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "asuka_reply",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「对。今天发现一个问题，只需要改流程。正式启用后才发现，就可能由患者替我们付代价。」",
        "expression": "warm",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "asuka_reply_next",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "koi_ready",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ],
        "actor_id": "doc_asuka",
        "outfit": "white_coat"
      },
      {
        "id": "koi_ready",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "七瀬恋已经换好刷手服，逐项核对墙上的接口。\n「手术护理组到齐。记录从开门时间开始，谁说‘差不多’我就记谁的名字。」",
        "expression": "focused",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "koi_ready_next",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "miyuki_ready",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ],
        "actor_id": "nurse_haru",
        "outfit": "scrubs"
      },
      {
        "id": "miyuki_ready",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "朝倉美幸抱紧记录板。\n「我负责记录！如果写得太慢——不，今天不会写得太慢。」",
        "expression": "warm",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "miyuki_ready_next",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "mika_ready",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ],
        "actor_id": "nurse_yui",
        "outfit": "scrubs"
      },
      {
        "id": "mika_ready",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "中井美佳推着空转运床停在黄线外。\n「转运、固定、交接。我会从患者的视角重新走一遍。」",
        "expression": "focused",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "mika_ready_next",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "sayaka_ready",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ],
        "actor_id": "nurse_rin",
        "outfit": "scrubs"
      },
      {
        "id": "sayaka_ready",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "明日香还在说明控制面板，南条小夜香的手指已经停在升降键上方。\n「这组按键我可以先试——」",
        "expression": "smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "sayaka_ready_next",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "asuka_stops_sayaka",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ],
        "actor_id": "doc_sayaka",
        "outfit": "scrubs"
      },
      {
        "id": "asuka_stops_sayaka",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「南条医生。我还没有说可以触碰。」",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "asuka_stops_sayaka_next",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "sayaka_asks_permission",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ],
        "actor_id": "doc_asuka",
        "outfit": "white_coat"
      },
      {
        "id": "sayaka_asks_permission",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "南条的手立刻停住，离按钮还有一指距离。\n「好。那么现在，我可以问什么时候能碰了吗？」",
        "expression": "smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "sayaka_asks_permission_next",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "narumi_ready",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ],
        "actor_id": "doc_sayaka",
        "outfit": "scrubs"
      },
      {
        "id": "narumi_ready",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "神宮寺成美按下门控按钮，看着气密门完整闭合。\n「那就别把它当空房间。只要流程开始，台上就已经有一个会害怕、会疼、也可能突然恶化的人。」",
        "expression": "focused",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "narumi_ready_next",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "act2_open",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ],
        "actor_id": "doc_aoi",
        "outfit": "scrubs"
      },
      {
        "id": "act2_open",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "【第二幕：设备与无菌区】\n团队从气源、电源、负压吸引、备用照明和麻醉机自检开始，沿着墙面逐项移动。",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "act2_open_next",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "asuka_manual",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ],
        "hide_portrait": true
      },
      {
        "id": "asuka_manual",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "明日香合上设备手册。\n「手册写着‘已安装’，验收单写着‘已测试’。现在我要听真正使用它的人说：出了问题，第一步找哪里？」",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "asuka_manual_next",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "equipment_choice",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ],
        "actor_id": "doc_asuka",
        "outfit": "white_coat"
      },
      {
        "id": "equipment_choice",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "坂口沿着电源与气源接口看了一遍。",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "equipment_trace",
            "label": "先追踪患者生命支持链",
            "next": "narumi_check",
            "requirements": []
          },
          {
            "id": "equipment_failure",
            "label": "先假设主电源失效",
            "next": "narumi_check",
            "requirements": []
          },
          {
            "id": "equipment_handoff",
            "label": "让每个岗位说出自己的备用方案",
            "next": "narumi_check",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "narumi_check",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "成美把麻醉回路接到测试肺。\n「氧源、通气、监护，顺序不能乱。设备报警不是让人安静下来的声音，是让团队重新分工的信号。」",
        "expression": "focused",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "narumi_check_next",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "koi_count",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ],
        "actor_id": "doc_aoi",
        "outfit": "scrubs"
      },
      {
        "id": "koi_count",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "七瀬恋打开器械包，只检查封口、指示卡与数量，没有触碰无菌区。\n「未启用的房间也按启用标准走。否则坏习惯会比患者先住进来。」",
        "expression": "focused",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "koi_count_next",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "manami_slot",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ],
        "actor_id": "nurse_haru",
        "outfit": "scrubs"
      },
      {
        "id": "manami_slot",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "药品柜与急救药车进入验收环节。",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "hear_manami",
            "label": "请真奈美复核药品安全",
            "next": "manami_line",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ],
        "hide_portrait": true,
        "requirements": [
          {
            "type": "staff_unlocked",
            "actor_id": "pharmacist_manami"
          }
        ],
        "fallback_next": "act3_open"
      },
      {
        "id": "manami_line",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "飯村真奈美没有先看药名，而是先看储存温度和封签编号。\n「同一种药放在不同位置，就会制造两套记忆。急救时最危险的不是找不到，是以为自己知道它在哪里。」",
        "expression": "focused",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "manami_line_next",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "act3_open",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ],
        "actor_id": "pharmacist_manami",
        "outfit": "scrubs"
      },
      {
        "id": "act3_open",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "【第三幕：手术台与体位训练】\n设备验收完成后，明日香把手术台降到转运高度。今天没有模型，她要求用真人把每一步重新做实。",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "act3_open_next",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "asuka_volunteer",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ],
        "hide_portrait": true
      },
      {
        "id": "asuka_volunteer",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「需要一名自愿者。不会进行侵入操作，任何不舒服都可以立刻停止。」",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "asuka_volunteer_next",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "koi_volunteer",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ],
        "actor_id": "doc_asuka",
        "outfit": "white_coat"
      },
      {
        "id": "koi_volunteer",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "七瀬恋已经把记录板递给美幸。\n「我来。总得有人告诉你们，写在流程里的‘舒适体位’到底舒不舒服。」",
        "expression": "warm",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "koi_volunteer_next",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "mika_transfer",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ],
        "actor_id": "nurse_haru",
        "outfit": "scrubs"
      },
      {
        "id": "mika_transfer",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "美佳把转运床与手术台锁定，先报高度，再报缝隙。\n「三、二、一。移动。」\n每个人只在口令对应的时点发力，七瀬恋平稳落到台面中央。",
        "expression": "focused",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "mika_transfer_next",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "player_position",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ],
        "actor_id": "nurse_rin",
        "outfit": "scrubs"
      },
      {
        "id": "player_position",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "坂口检查头颈、肩部、上肢和骶尾部受压点，又确认安全带没有压迫呼吸。\n「体位不是把人摆得像术式图。要让她在无法自己调整的时候仍然安全。」",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "player_position_next",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "koi_feedback",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "koi_feedback",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "七瀬恋抬了抬右手。\n「右肩有一点悬空。还有，安全带再低两指会更舒服。」",
        "expression": "worried",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "koi_feedback_next",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "miyuki_note",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ],
        "actor_id": "nurse_haru",
        "outfit": "scrubs"
      },
      {
        "id": "miyuki_note",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "安全带略微偏高。美幸几乎没有思考便松开卡扣，垫住患者皮肤，把固定点重新移到既不限制呼吸、又不会滑脱的位置。\n七瀬恋侧过脸：「朝倉，你不是第一次碰这种台子吗？」\n「这个型号是第一次。」\n「……型号？」\n美幸眨眨眼，低头在记录板上补了一行，像是什么也没发生。",
        "expression": "focused",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "miyuki_note_next",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "aqua_slot",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ],
        "actor_id": "nurse_yui",
        "outfit": "scrubs"
      },
      {
        "id": "aqua_slot",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "接下来要验证截石位附件和防压伤垫。",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "hear_aqua",
            "label": "请妇科主任确认截石位",
            "next": "aqua_line",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ],
        "hide_portrait": true,
        "requirements": [
          {
            "type": "staff_unlocked",
            "actor_id": "doc_aqua"
          }
        ],
        "fallback_next": "hiroko_slot"
      },
      {
        "id": "aqua_line",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "阿库娅一看见两侧腿架就精神起来。\n「终于到我的专业领域了！腿不能一边先抬、一边后放，放下时也一样。腰骶、腓总神经、髋关节——一个都不许拿来换‘摆得快’！」\n她停顿一下，小声补充：「还有，先告诉志愿者要做什么。突然把人架起来真的很吓人。」",
        "expression": "excited",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "aqua_line_next",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "hiroko_slot",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ],
        "actor_id": "doc_aqua",
        "outfit": "scrubs"
      },
      {
        "id": "hiroko_slot",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "团队重新检查防压伤垫、约束带和皮肤观察点。",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "hear_hiroko",
            "label": "请弘子从巡回护士角度复核",
            "next": "hiroko_line",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ],
        "hide_portrait": true,
        "requirements": [
          {
            "type": "staff_unlocked",
            "actor_id": "nurse_hiroko"
          }
        ],
        "fallback_next": "act4_open"
      },
      {
        "id": "hiroko_line",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "杉村弘子绕手术台走了一圈，伸手比了比术中还能接触到的位置。\n「铺巾以后看不见的地方，现在就要确认。皮肤、管路、回路都一样。看不见不等于不会出事。」",
        "expression": "focused",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "hiroko_line_next",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "act4_open",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ],
        "actor_id": "nurse_hiroko",
        "outfit": "scrubs"
      },
      {
        "id": "act4_open",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "【第四幕：模拟接台】\n七瀬恋继续担任模拟患者。团队从门外的转运床重新开始，在她完整知情并配合的前提下，把“患者”送入手术间；所有信息都必须被说出来、听见并复述。",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "act4_open_next",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "mika_handoff",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ],
        "hide_portrait": true
      },
      {
        "id": "mika_handoff",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「模拟患者，腕带与手术同意书一致。过敏史已确认。术式、部位、麻醉计划待团队共同复核。」\n中井美佳没有因为这是演练就省略任何一句。\n「医生通常看到患者时，她已经躺好了。可对患者来说，手术从病房推走的那一刻就已经开始了。」",
        "expression": "focused",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "mika_handoff_next",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "narumi_timeout",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ],
        "actor_id": "nurse_rin",
        "outfit": "scrubs"
      },
      {
        "id": "narumi_timeout",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "成美抬手让所有人停下。\n「现在开始安全核查。说话的人看着团队，听的人停止手上的动作。核查不是背景音。」",
        "expression": "focused",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "narumi_timeout_next",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "shiori_slot",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ],
        "actor_id": "doc_aoi",
        "outfit": "scrubs"
      },
      {
        "id": "shiori_slot",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "模拟病例还包括高血压、糖代谢异常与近期呼吸道症状。",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "hear_shiori",
            "label": "请詩織作围术期评估",
            "next": "shiori_line",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ],
        "hide_portrait": true,
        "requirements": [
          {
            "type": "staff_unlocked",
            "actor_id": "doc_shiori"
          }
        ],
        "fallback_next": "kaori_slot"
      },
      {
        "id": "shiori_line",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "藤崎詩織把几项数据排到一起。\n「单看每一项都不到取消手术的程度，但合起来会改变麻醉风险。先确认症状趋势和功能状态，再决定今天是否继续。」\n她看向术野方向。\n「别只看眼前这一块。」",
        "expression": "focused",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "shiori_line_next",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "kaori_slot",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ],
        "actor_id": "doc_shiori",
        "outfit": "scrubs"
      },
      {
        "id": "kaori_slot",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "模拟进入麻醉诱导后的监护与记录。",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "hear_kaori",
            "label": "请佳織检查监护与记录",
            "next": "kaori_line",
            "requirements": []
          }
        ],
        "hide_portrait": true,
        "requirements": [
          {
            "type": "staff_unlocked",
            "actor_id": "doc_rei"
          }
        ],
        "fallback_next": "ange_slot"
      },
      {
        "id": "kaori_line",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "深山佳織把监护趋势拉长到十分钟。\n「单个数字正常，不代表趋势正常。记录里必须看得出什么时候变化、当时做了什么、患者如何回应。」",
        "expression": "focused",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "kaori_line_next",
            "label": "继续",
            "next": "ange_slot",
